#: ../../language/attributes/proof.md:1
msgid "Proof Attributes"
msgstr "証明属性"

#: ../../language/attributes/proof.md:3
msgid ""
"MoonBit's experimental formal-verification pipeline recognizes three built-"
"in proof attributes:"
msgstr ""
"MoonBit の実験的な形式検証パイプラインは、3 つの組み込み証明属性を認識しま"
"す："

#: ../../language/attributes/proof.md:6
msgid ""
"`#proof_pure` makes a side-effect-free function available to both executable "
"code and proof-oriented logic."
msgstr ""
"`#proof_pure` は、副作用のない関数を実行可能コードと証明用ロジックの両方で利"
"用できるようにします。"

#: ../../language/attributes/proof.md:8
msgid ""
"`#proof_external(module, symbol)` tells proof lowering to represent an "
"abstract MoonBit type with a type from a Why3 module."
msgstr ""
"`#proof_external(module, symbol)` は、検証への変換時に抽象 MoonBit 型を Why3 "
"モジュールの型で表すよう指定します。"

#: ../../language/attributes/proof.md:10
msgid ""
"`#proof_import(module)` declares a proof-only `.mbtp` stub for an operation "
"from a Why3 module. The stub's string body names the Why3 symbol."
msgstr ""
"`#proof_import(module)` は、Why3 モジュールの操作に対応する証明専用の "
"`.mbtp` スタブを宣言します。スタブの文字列本体は Why3 シンボルを指定します。"

#: ../../language/attributes/proof.md:13
msgid ""
"`#proof_external` and `#proof_import` affect verification lowering only and "
"do not provide runtime implementations or FFI bindings. For their syntax, "
"restrictions, trust model, and examples, see [Formal Verification](/language/"
"verification.md#proof-specific-annotations)."
msgstr ""
"`#proof_external` と `#proof_import` は検証への変換だけに影響し、実行時実装"
"や FFI バインディングは提供しません。構文、制約、信頼モデル、および例について"
"は、[形式検証](/language/verification.md#proof-specific-annotations)を参照し"
"てください。"
